1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[a painted dot on plaster]

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:20,000
[a slow electronic drone — Laurie Spiegel, "Voices Within"]

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:52,000
[surface noise; faint crackle]

4
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:12,000
[crying, far off, under the music]

5
00:01:40,000 --> 00:02:07,900
[whispering; a low approach rising under it, soured]

6
00:02:08,170 --> 00:02:16,000
[a hit — Full of Hell & Nothing, "Rose Tinted World"]

7
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:46,000
[torn voices; radio static]

8
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:44,000
[a litany of words, sorted by length]

9
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:20,000
[sirens]

10
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:24,000
[a blast]

11
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:34,000
[a blast]

12
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:44,500
[a blast; a scream]

13
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:49,400
[screaming; crying; a crowd]

14
00:04:49,550 --> 00:04:52,700
[a roar, close]

15
00:04:52,751 --> 00:04:53,150
[the picture is taken away]

16
00:04:53,193 --> 00:04:54,600
(whispered) I hate you

17
00:04:54,795 --> 00:04:56,795
[the dot, in silence]
